{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And all the fat of the bull.</b> It should have said 'its fat' — what does 'bull' come to teach? To include the bull of Yom HaKippurim for the kidneys and the fats and the caudate lobe (Sifra)." "<b>The sin-offering.</b> To bring the goats of idolatry for the kidneys and for the fats and for the caudate lobe (there)." "<b>He shall remove from it.</b> From the attached part — that he shall not cut it up before the removal of its fat. Torat Kohanim."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:04:53.953330204Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}